WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.767
-Guys, it's time to take a look
at the stories making headlines

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.300
today and weigh the good
with the bad.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.300
It's time for "Pros and Cons."
Here we go.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.067
♪ -Pros and cons
and pros and cons and pros ♪

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.467
-Tonight we'll be taking a look
at the pros and cons of

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:15.234
Thanksgiving travel.

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:17.334
That's right -- tomorrow is
Thanksgiving, and this year,

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:19.834
the number of people traveling
to see their families is

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:22.801
expected to get back to
nearly pre-pandemic levels.

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:26.501
So let's take a look at the pros
and cons of Thanksgiving travel.

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:27.634
Here we go right here.

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:30.000
Pro -- you'll finally get to see
your family.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.834
Con -- you'll finally get to see
your family.

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.701
It's a real double-edged sword.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.567
-Blessing and a curse.
-Pro -- 4.2 million Americans

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.067
will travel by airplane.

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:42.701
Con -- And they all believe
they deserve the armrest.

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:45.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:48.701
Pro -- Listening to the radio
on a family road trip.

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:51.901
Con -- Hearing dad try to hit
that high note in "Easy on Me."

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:56.400
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Vocalizes ]

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.501
Pro -- Getting vaccinated
so that you can eat

00:00:58.501 --> 00:01:00.267
Thanksgiving dinner
with your family.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:03.100
Con -- Having to sit at
the Johnson &amp; Johnson table.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.167
Oh, that's --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:08.467
Come on!
-In the basement.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.734
-Pro -- there's less
vehicle traffic

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:12.367
if you leave late Wednesday.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:15.300
Con -- Assuming Waze doesn't
give the other 20,000 people

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.667
the same "shortcut."

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:17.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.968 --> 00:01:19.801
You're special.

00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:21.100
-No way, everybody's going
this weird road.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.200
-Yeah, you're special.
We didn't tell anyone else.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.267
Pro -- Everyone on the plane
wears a mask

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:27.033
to prevent the spread of COVID.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:29.667
Con -- until they bust out
those Biscoff cookies,

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.734
then all bets are off.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:35.434
"Ooh, are those Biscoff?"

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:41.100
Nom, nom, nom.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.467
Pro -- American
and Alaska Airlines

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:45.868
require their employees
to be vaccinated.

00:01:45.868 --> 00:01:48.501
Con -- Southwest is handing out
Flintstone vitamins

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:52.934
and hoping for the best.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:54.968
Pro -- If you're nervous to fly,

00:01:54.968 --> 00:01:57.434
some airports have
emotional support animals.

00:01:57.434 --> 00:01:59.467
Con -- They're all provided by
Joe Exotic.

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:01.467
[ Laughter ]
There you go, everybody.

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:02.801
Those are the "Pros and Cons."

